//- 每次页面加载上报一次（匿名 ID + 页面路径 + 标题），数据进 PJ Studio 统一看板。采集端源码见仓库根目录 analytics/
script.
  (function () {
    if (/^(localhost|127\.0\.0\.1|\[::1\])$/.test(location.hostname)) return;
    if (navigator.doNotTrack === '1' || navigator.globalPrivacyControl) return;
    var uuid = function () {
      if (window.crypto && crypto.randomUUID) return crypto.randomUUID();
      var bytes = crypto.getRandomValues(new Uint8Array(16)), hex = [];
      bytes[6] = bytes[6] & 15 | 64; bytes[8] = bytes[8] & 63 | 128;
      for (var i = 0; i < 16; i++) hex.push((bytes[i] + 256).toString(16).slice(1));
      return hex.slice(0, 4).join('') + '-' + hex.slice(4, 6).join('') + '-' + hex.slice(6, 8).join('') + '-' + hex.slice(8, 10).join('') + '-' + hex.slice(10).join('');
    };
    // 浏览器本地的匿名 ID，只用来按天和区间去重 UV
    var id;
    try {
      id = localStorage.getItem('pjhubs_visitor_id');
      if (!/^[0-9a-f]{8}-[0-9a-f]{4}-4[0-9a-f]{3}-[89ab][0-9a-f]{3}-[0-9a-f]{12}$/i.test(id || '')) {
        id = uuid();
        localStorage.setItem('pjhubs_visitor_id', id);
      }
    } catch (e) {
      id = uuid();
    }
    // 看板里按文章统计，标题去掉站点名后缀
    var suffix = ' | ' + '#{config.title}', title = document.title;
    if (title.slice(-suffix.length) === suffix) title = title.slice(0, -suffix.length);
    var url = '#{theme.cf_stats.endpoint}';
    var body = JSON.stringify({ visitorID: id, path: location.pathname, title: title.slice(0, 200) });
    // text/plain 的跨域 POST 不需要预检；不带 cookie
    if (window.fetch) {
      fetch(url, { method: 'POST', body: body, mode: 'no-cors', credentials: 'omit', keepalive: true }).catch(function () {});
    } else if (navigator.sendBeacon) {
      navigator.sendBeacon(url, body);
    }
  })();
